after tunneling through the rabbit hole  Alice found herself in a dark ocean it  was dark  until she spotted some strange creatures  swimming around they were in fact  photons packets of energy emitted from  an atom they were different colors  depending on how excited they were to  have escaped the clutches of their home  atom they swam a synchronous dance a  backstroke of oscillating electric and  magnetic fields lighting up the ocean  Alice washed up near a ring of even more  curious creatures orbiting around a dodo  from listening to the dodo speak Alice  concluded that he must be very dense the  creatures were electrons and seemed to  dance in a very particular pattern  around the dodo every now and then waves  would wash over and fill the space when  this happened the creatures would become  indistinguishable from the waves in fact  everything in this world seemed to  behave like both particles and waves at  times emerging from the sea  Alice was sad to find herself too weak  to join the dance no matter how fast she  tried to run she just couldn't keep up  that was until a kind bird gave her a  ride on his beak propping her up to a  lower energy level where she could  comfortably join in that's when the  white rabbit appeared again flying in on  a tailspin he looked like he was going  somewhere important so Alice emitted  herself from the dance and followed  after them both lighting up the forest  as they went
 

